 "method": "Estimates derived from standard Co-60 dosimetry parameters. Primary fluence uses exponential attenuation with \u03bc/\u03c1 from NIST XCOM. Total fluence applies a standard exponential buildup factor (~1.35) for 10\u00d710 cm\u00b2 field at 5 cm depth. Interaction fractions and energy transfer coefficients use NIST/ICRU mass energy-transfer data for water at ~1.25 MeV. Electron initial spectra model Compton and photoelectric deposition characteristics, softened in the slowing-down stage by collisional energy loss. Kerma and dose computed via collision mass energy-absorption coefficients. Stopping-power ratio from ICRU Report 37. PDD calculated from standard TMR and inverse-square corrections.",
